cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below and cite
  the pinned DeepRacing source dataset separately.
title: "BRACE: Bayesian Racing-Envelope Alert for Crossing Events"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Anonymous
abstract: >-
  Reproducible software for circuit-held-out Bayesian forecasting of mapped
  car-center track-boundary excursions in open-wheel racing simulation. It is
  not a Formula 1 crash, barrier-contact, injury, or active-padding validation
  system.
keywords:
  - Bayesian forecasting
  - motorsport analytics
  - trajectory prediction
  - uncertainty quantification
  - track-boundary excursion
